# Keep the build context small + host-only. crates/* (all workspace members) and
# Cargo.lock are intentionally included — cargo needs every member's manifest to
# resolve the workspace, even though only `server` is compiled.
# NOTE: /firmware-dist must stay IN the context — the Dockerfile copies it into
# the runtime image (the server hosts it as the OTA firmware release). The
# anchored /firmware and /firmware-rs patterns match only those exact names.
/target
/firmware-rs
/firmware
/ios
/.git
